    "blocks": [
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "デザフェスおつかれさまでした☀︎"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Design Festa 辛苦大家啦☀︎"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Thank you for your hard work at Design Festa ☀︎"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "グッズではありますが、久しぶりの新作ありイベント本当に楽しかったです(°▽°)"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "虽然卖的是周边，不过时隔许久带着新作参加活动，真的超开心(°▽°)"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "They were goods, but there was something new for the first time in a while, and the event was really fun(°▽°)"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "みんなは楽しんでくれたかな？？"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "大家玩得开心吗？？"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Did you all have fun??"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "また次のイベントでよろしくお願いします。"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "下一次活动也请多多关照啦。"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Looking forward to seeing you again at the next event."
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "さてさて、お話は変わって……"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "好了好了，换个话题……"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Now then, on to a different topic……"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "じゃーーーーーん！！"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "锵————！！"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Ta-daaaaaa!!"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
