        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "I went!"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "念願のポケモンカフェ🍰"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "心心念念的宝可梦咖啡馆🍰"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "To the Pokémon Cafe I'd been longing to visit 🍰"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "デザフェスでも売り子をしてくれたへちま嬢と、女子力爆発させてきちゃいましたよ〜〜\n"
          },
          {
            "type": "image",
            "alt": "image",
            "media": "2542fb5d8eac.png",
            "source": "https://parts.lineblog.me/img/emoji/line/1/00505.png"
          }
        ],
        "zh": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "和 Design Festa 时帮我卖货的へちま小姐一起，把女子力彻底拉满啦〜〜"
            }
          ]
        ],
        "en": [
          [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "I went with Miss Hechima, who also helped sell goods at Design Festa, and we let our girly power explode~~"
            }
          ]
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "content": [
          {
